type: software
title: "SWiPS: Smart Warning and Pedestrian Safety System"
abstract: "A two-pole portable edge AI pedestrian advisory system using YOLOv8n NCNN on Raspberry Pi 5 for unsignalized campus crosswalks. Implements a 3-state Moore machine FSM with MQTT inter-pole synchronization and InfluxDB logging."
